313c8651f57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/f903acbb55b62e3ddfc8301480067313c8651f57"},"message":"Rework getAvailableIp\n\nThis commit reworks getAvailableIp with a \"simpler\" version that will\nlook for the first available IP address in our IP Prefix.\n\nThere is a couple of ideas behind this:\n\n* Make the host IPs reasonably predictable and in within similar\n  subnets, which should simplify ACLs for subnets\n* The code is not random, but deterministic so we can have tests\n* The code is a bit more understandable (no bit shift magic)","parents":[{"sha":"309f868a2113c9cf1ba193f744ff135808829eb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/309f868a2113c9cf1ba193f744ff135808829eb0","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/309f868a2113c9cf1ba193f744ff135808829eb0"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"sha":"9f85efffd5fc2b3d8c9cd7057c8dfab4a691d3c5","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0MjczODcxODU5OjlmODVlZmZmZDVmYzJiM2Q4YzljZDcwNTdjOGRmYWI0YTY5MWQzYzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/9f85efffd5fc2b3d8c9cd7057c8dfab4a691d3c5","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/9f85efffd5fc2b3d8c9cd7057c8dfab4a691d3c5","author":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kradalby@kradalby.no","date":"2021-08-02T21:06:15Z"},"committer":{"name":"Kristoffer Dalby","email":"kradalby@kradalby.no","date":"2021-08-02T21:06:15Z"},"tree":{"sha":"dcee93e1e67ad86ad4e6742dc842160f3f0ae0a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/dcee93e1e67ad86ad4e6742dc842160f3f0ae0a7"},"message":"Update readme","parents":[{"sha":"b5841c8a8b088338db8cbda474a85243452c9433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/b5841c8a8b088338db8cbda474a85243452c9433","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/b5841c8a8b088338db8cbda474a85243452c9433"}],"verificatio